				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				351,
				3
			],
			"Message": "feat(integration): Add MountainWindSync service and enhance instantiation\n\nThis commit introduces the MountainWindSync service for real-time synchronization between the Wind frontend and Mountain backend. The service provides bidirectional communication, configuration sync, and error handling with retry mechanisms. Additionally, the WindInstantiationService is enhanced with advanced disposal patterns, performance tracking, and robust error handling including fallback dependencies for graceful degradation.\n\nKey changes:\n- Added MountainWindSync.ts with event listeners, sync logic, and status management\n- Enhanced WindInstantiationService.ts disposal to cascade and log performance\n- Improved instantiation error handling with circuit breaker patterns and fallbacks\n- Updated AUTONOMOUS-WORKFLOW.md to reflect completed components\n\nThese changes improve the reliability and maintainability of the Wind framework, supporting better integration and service management.",
			"SHA": "28531bec65a9a349a00a0e6f2c292433a5d88532"
		}
	],
